1
00:00:00,861 --> 00:00:04,361
(Sheldon:)Oh. How much does it cost
to get them off my lap?

2
00:00:05,833 --> 00:00:07,713
(James:)No. Something about a convention.

3
00:00:08,369 --> 00:00:10,279
Oh, right! Well...

4
00:00:10,437 --> 00:00:13,437
(Sheldon:)...my friends and I couldn't
get into Comic-Con this year,

5
00:00:13,607 --> 00:00:16,217
(Sheldon:)and I was trying to start
my own convention,

6
00:00:16,377 --> 00:00:20,117
(Sheldon:)and I was going to ask
if you would be a panelist.

7
00:00:21,048 --> 00:00:23,498
(James:)Why don't you and your friends
come to Comic-Can with me?

8
00:00:23,651 --> 00:00:25,151
(Howard:)-Really?
-Of course.

9
00:00:25,319 --> 00:00:27,389
(James:)And San Diego is
right across the border

10
00:00:27,554 --> 00:00:31,564
from my favourite city on Earth,
Tijuana...

11
00:00:33,727 --> 00:00:35,707
(James:)...where I'm taking you
every night!

12
00:00:38,198 --> 00:00:39,538
Ay-ay-ay.

13
00:00:41,068 --> 00:00:43,018
Ay-ay-ay, bang-bang.

14
00:00:49,677 --> 00:00:52,517
(James:)So, Beau Bridges
is on my shoulders,

15
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:56,060
(James:)and Jeff Bridges is
on Marlon Brando's shoulders,

16
00:00:56,216 --> 00:00:59,596
(James:)and remember, we do not have
permission to be in the pool.

17
00:00:59,753 --> 00:01:01,823
Hey! Sheldon, wake up!

18
00:01:02,990 --> 00:01:05,660
(James:)Angie Dickinson is about to
sic the dogs on us,

19
00:01:05,826 --> 00:01:08,276
(James:)and I go under the water and
Marlon goes under the water,

20
00:01:08,429 --> 00:01:10,099
(James:)and the water raises
about two feet

21
00:01:10,264 --> 00:01:11,574
(James:)and sloshes all over her patio,

22
00:01:11,732 --> 00:01:13,612
(James:)and the dogs freak out
and run like hell,

23
00:01:13,767 --> 00:01:15,267
(James:)then we run like hell....

24
00:01:15,769 --> 00:01:17,109
Oh, boy!

25
00:01:17,271 --> 00:01:19,081
(James:)That was a lot of fun.

26
00:01:21,442 --> 00:01:23,282
(Sheldon:)Who's Angie Dickinson?

